# k.scenes/shards/things-q: the usual place (sky, ground, water, indoors, on another thing) and the relative size (tiny to huge) of 2 drawable things whose name starts with "q"; labelled by a language model from the names (named=model), a sample checked against the drawings.
# sources: hand-core 1 (hand-written in this repository: sources/hand-core/place-size.tsv)
# license: CC0-1.0
# script: tools/scenes-core.mjs

@k.scenes.thing.quail k.scenes.thing name=quail place=ground size=small named=model core.source="hand-core 1"
@k.scenes.thing.quiche_flan k.scenes.thing name="quiche flan" place=indoors on=table size=small named=model core.source="hand-core 1"
